---
description: Never add Cursor as co-author on git commits
alwaysApply: true
---

When committing changes for this repository:

- Do NOT add `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` or any Cursor co-author trailer.
- Use only the user's git identity as author.
- If a commit message already includes a Cursor co-author line, remove it before committing.
